## Decoração ##

<style>
p { margin: 14px; }
</style>
<div class="col50p terminal example">
text-decoration: underline;

text-decoration: overline;

text-decoration: line-through ;

</div>
<div class=col50p>
<p style="text-decoration: underline; ">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet</p>
<p style="text-decoration: overline; ">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet</p>
<p style="text-decoration: line-through ; ">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet</p>
</div>


* Decoração de texto dada pela propriedade <code class=focus>text-decoration</code>
* Os valores são nomes predifinidos: 
     * <code class=focus>underline</code>
     * <code class=focus>overline</code>
     * <code class=focus>line-through</code>
     * <code class=focus>blink</code> 
     * <code class=focus>none</code>